o it in these situations: <ul> <li>at the airport</li> <li>at the police station</li> <li>when you get a library card</li> <li>when you get a new phone</li> <li>at the bank</li></ul>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Police Officer</span>: What is your address?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Andrew</span>: It's 18 Leslie Lane.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Police Officer</span>: What's your date of birth?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Andrew</span>: It's December 27th, 1982.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Giving personal information includes: <ul><li>your first and last name</li> <li>your address</li> <li>your phone number</li> <li>your date of birth</li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to shout", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to talk very loudly; to yell", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: His ex was shouting at us.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to tell a story.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "siren", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thing that makes a loud noise, used in emergencies", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I heard sirens coming near us.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "distance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place that is far away", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I heard sirens in the distance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cops", "type": "name"}, {"content": "casual word for police", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"co